      <p begin="00:44.034" end="00:47.516" ttm:agent="v1">B**** you know you love it here</p>
      <p begin="00:47.516" end="00:51.178" ttm:agent="v1">That's why you keep on coming near</p>
      <p begin="00:51.178" end="00:54.602" ttm:agent="v1">Your nigga can't compete i swear</p>
      <p begin="00:54.602" end="00:58.122" ttm:agent="v1">He tried but now he look to weak baby</p>
